AOSP path convention
====================

In the Android source tree, this sched-ext/scx repository should be the
project rooted at:

  external/scx/

So the Soong file in this repository is:

  external/scx/Android.bp   (i.e. ../Android.bp at repo root)

Do not add a second Android.bp under external/scx/ inside the same checkout:
that would appear as external/scx/external/scx/Android.bp when this repo is
already mounted at external/scx.

Regenerate Android.bp from Cargo (full AOSP checkout):

  cd external/scx
  m cargo_embargo
  cargo_embargo generate cargo_embargo.json
